urrent setup of `/var/lib/incus/storage-pools/3tched/3tchedCtlChatbot.img`. The file `/opt/run-mounts/persist` and `@agent_memory` require further inspection to match the partitions. It's likely the ext4 partition is needed for Cozo's performance, while the btrfs partition provides the root filesystem's read/write capabilities via btrfs.\n\n\nVerified the image setup: Partition 1 is Btrfs (10 GiB), and partition 2 is also Btrfs (20 GiB). There's currently no ext4 partition for Cozo. Only 576 MiB is used on the 10 GiB Btrfs partition, confirming a large amount of free space. The response will explicitly state these findings.\n\n\n"}
